error[condition-not-bool] 2:5-2:16
  (if (some true) "present" "absent")
      ^^^^^^^^^^^
  An if condition must be true or false, but this is an Option<Bool>.
  Presence and truth would disagree: (some false) is present but false.
  Match on it instead: (match (some true) (some v) ... none ...).
  Help: sx help if
